  "contentHtml": "<p>우도에 다녀왔습니다.&#160;</p><p>날씨도 따뜻하고, 하늘도 맑고..</p><p>검멀레 해안에는 수성화산 분출로 쌓은 응회암과 그 위를 덮은 용암의&#160; 다양한 구조를 볼 수 있습니다.&#160;</p><p>우도 지질 답사 한번 가시죠.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55aa898afafa62fff496d6ee7b98421b275cc433\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"643\" height=\"482\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55aa898afafa62fff496d6ee7b98421b275cc433\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">배에서 바라 본 우도봉 전경</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc174864000bebded609e2f5a0bb2fe78c8410b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"643\" height=\"332\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc174864000bebded609e2f5a0bb2fe78c8410b\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"496\"><div class=\"figcaption\">우도봉에서 바라본 제주도 왼쪽 성산일출봉, 가운데 한라산, 오른쪽 지미봉</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/011474f9b0ef873d08525c12d896f82c6a72c997\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"641\" height=\"481\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/011474f9b0ef873d08525c12d896f82c6a72c997\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">수성화산에 의해 쌓인 응회암</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/38e0831b219a8d58fba16f132c35cf4705792a54\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"643\" height=\"482\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/38e0831b219a8d58fba16f132c35cf4705792a54\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">우도 응회암층</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0f2e8c3d97011c7f2237410d834c42a0a14e87\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"642\" height=\"482\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0f2e8c3d97011c7f2237410d834c42a0a14e87\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">금방 날아와 응회암에 박힌듯한 화산탄</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d94e53a7227776e1ec4696cef0a6faa811bd7a8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"642\" height=\"856\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d94e53a7227776e1ec4696cef0a6faa811bd7a8\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"2048\"><div class=\"figcaption\">방금 용암이 흘러서 굳은 듯한 로피구조</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a482ff9ce17a2d8b50b863a5a60c051e0a31d01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"643\" height=\"482\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a482ff9ce17a2d8b50b863a5a60c051e0a31d01\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">로피구조 위를 뒤덮은 응회암</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a136412f06eae9842e0e53085c1c72b811c856b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"642\" height=\"789\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a136412f06eae9842e0e53085c1c72b811c856b\" data-origin-width=\"1666\" data-origin-height=\"2048\"><div class=\"figcaption\">검멀레 해안 모래. 현무암, 응회암, 조개껍데기가 섞여있다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99edcb81d39f3bd53f28741660ba9f07419b3742\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"645\" height=\"484\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99edcb81d39f3bd53f28741660ba9f07419b3742\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">응회암을 깎고 그 위를 흐를 용암</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a04558a1b361f56f7c4b9b8779c77533fa8b6d25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"641\" height=\"481\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a04558a1b361f56f7c4b9b8779c77533fa8b6d25\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"><div class=\"figcaption\">해식동굴에서 바라본 풍경</div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
